Usage: vifstab [flags...] [operands...] <subcommand>

Verify fstab read-only with the caller's credentials.

Subcommands:
    diagram Print a partition diagram.
    edit    Edit, validate and save fstab explicitly, using inherited
            credentials.
    format  Print aligned fstab; writing requires --in-place.
    manpage Generate the manual page explicitly.
    uefi    Experimental live firmware correlation; unavailable observations
            remain unknown.
    verify  Verify fstab read-only with the caller's credentials.
    help    Print this help message
    usage   Print this usage message


Flags:
    --file string       (default: "/etc/fstab")   File to verify.

Positional Arguments:
    [operands...] No positional operands are accepted.
